0,Pai Tavytera - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pai_Tavytera,The Pai Tavytera are an indigenous people of Paraguay and Brazil. They primarily live in Amambay Department in Paraguay and the Brazilian state of Mato Grosso do Sul.,Pai Tavytera,Tupian
