2,Paï-Tavytera,https://www.everyculture.com/South-America/Pa-Tavytera.html,"""Paï-Tavytera"" is the name given today to the most northerly of the Guaraní tribes in eastern Paraguay. They distinguish themselves from two other Guaraní tribal groups, the Chiripá and the Mbyá, who are somewhat different in language and custom.",Pai Tavytera,Tupian
